      "type": "registry:base",
      "title": "democrito",
      "description": "Minimal, monochromatic atomic design system \u2014 warm stone grays with terracotta orange accent. Three themes \u2014 warm (default, `:root`), dark (`.dark`), light (`.light`) \u2014 three fonts, three surfaces. Tailwind CSS v4 + CSS-first config.",
