      "docs": "Minimal, monochromatic atomic design system with warm stone grays and terracotta orange accent. Requires Tailwind CSS v4.\n\n## Three themes\n- **Warm** (default, applied via `:root`) \u2014 Sanzo Wada earth-tones, terracotta accent\n- **Dark** (`.dark` class) \u2014 deep cold stone grays\n- **Light** (`.light` class) \u2014 warm off-whites\n\n## Three fonts\n- `font-display` \u2014 Plus Jakarta Sans (headings)\n- `font-body` \u2014 Satoshi (body text)\n- `font-mono` \u2014 JetBrains Mono (code/data)\n\n## Three surfaces\n`background` \u2192 `surface` \u2192 `card` creates depth without complexity.\n\n## Setup\n1. Install Tailwind v4: `npm i -D tailwindcss@^4 @tailwindcss/vite@^4`\n2. Add `@tailwindcss/vite` to `vite.config.ts` plugins\n3. In your `src/index.css`: `@import \"tailwindcss\"; @import \"tw-animate-css\";`\n4. Run `npx shadcn@latest add https://democrito.design/r/democrito.json`\n\nSee https://democrito.design for the full showcase.",
